  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Although we have made progress towards building a better world, too many people have been left behind. People who are unable to benefit from human development, innovation or economic growth.  In fact, millions of people around the world cannot afford a healthy diet, putting them at high risk of food insecurity and malnutrition. But ending hunger isn&apos;t only about supply. Enough food is produced today to feed everyone on the planet.</narrative>
